<https://query.example.org/def/nickname> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> <https://query.example.org/graph/terms> .
<https://query.example.org/def/nickname> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "nickname of a person"@en <https://query.example.org/graph/terms> .
